{{Quote|text=*chuckle* Few adventurers have scaled Mount Kohldur, once a great dwarf kingdom. Your achievement is a testament to your ambition and perseverance...}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a combat mage and second-in-command of [[The First Slash Guild]]. He is one of the 7 marriage candidates added by Stardew Valley Expanded.

Personality-wise, Lance is polite, confident, and curious, having studied arcane nature since youth. He considers the Player an adventurer of some renown by the time they meet.

{{TOC|limit=2}}

==Schedule==
Lance will follow his regular schedule after viewing his introduction cutscene at the [[Stardew:Forge|Forge]]. He rotates between [[Castle Village Outpost]], [[Stardew:Adventurer's Guild|the Adventurer's Guild]], [[Stardew:Ginger Island|Ginger Island]], and [[The Highlands]]. 

