{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = Life on Fable Reef|2 = Upon arrival at Fable Reef, the Farmer is greeted by Lance, who suggests that they start the day by patrolling the island. It follows a short montage, just like in the six heart event. Lance and the Farmer are shown on the beach, observing a swarm of Torpedo Trouts. Lance shows the Farmer how to make mana elixirs in the guild hall. They spent some quality time with Lance's friends, watching the ocean and standing around a campfire. The other guild members are shown to be very nice to the Farmer. The day ends in a sparingly decorated bedroom. Then suddenly Lance takes off his clothes and, while in his underwear, proclaims that the bed is only designed to fit one person and that he is not sure whether both him and the Farmer will be able to sleep in it.
In the dialogue box we are informed that Lance has a very muscular statue.
* '''I think we could make it work...'''
It turns out, that there was actually enough room for two people after all. Lance and the Farmer share a kiss.
* '''I'm going to head out. This was fun.'''
Lance chuckles, wishes the Farmer safe travels and states that the Farmer is always welcome at Fable Reef.}}
