{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = The Shadow Person In The Sewers|2 = The Farmer leads Lance into the sewers. Krobus immediatly recognizes Lance as the Farmers life partner based on smell alone. Lance remarks on Krobus' impeccable senses and friendly introductions ensue. Then Lance expresses that based on his previous experiences with shadowpeople, he couldn't quite believe that Krobus would be so friendly. Krobus says, that they feel sorry, that Lance had bad experiences with their people. Lance proceeds to call Krobus special and remarks on Krobus short height, compared to other shadowpeople and shows concern about Krobus' nutrition. They seem unbothered though, and explain that they sustain themselves based on flies from the sewers and whatever they can find in the garbage cans around town. Lance seems unhappy with that answer and tells Krobus that that is in no way adequate for them and teleports away to fetch Krobus a void root. Krobus tells the player, that Lance seems nice. After eating the void root, Krobus seems very happy.
After the cutscene ends, Lance will tell the Farmer, that he got along with Krobus really well and that both of them would like to meet up again. From now on, both will meet on the 10th and 24th of each season at night at the sewer gate below Fairhaven Farm.}}
