{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = Dino Island |2 = The player finds Lance gazing from the shore. He invites them to his side, then asks if they've ever visited a nearby island with dinosaurs. They turn to him, and Lance chuckles about their anticipation for adventure. He instructs to hold onto him as he takes them there.

Upon teleporting to its shore, a dinosaur almost attacks the player. It only startles them before it walks away. Lance explains that the island's inhabitants are peaceful, though they'd best avoid that one. Afterwards, he tells the Farmer he wants it to be their journey, and has them lead the way.

Together, Lance and the player explore the dinosaur island. They end up in a lava lake with many nested dino eggs. Lance says he's reminded of when he first laid eyes on the Farmer. As they stand side-by-side, he asks if it's just him, or if it's getting "hot in here". The player turns to Lance, he turns to them, and they end their journey with a kiss.
